#showas:符印对决
This hard scenario features 2 AI types. The Aggressor AI (diff 7) will regularly send ships to harass our borders and the Panopticon AI (diff 7) has eyes built everywhere, including some unique ones of its own design.

There are four Showdown devices seeded in the galaxy. If we control three of them, we can start the showdown and force the AI to bring the fight to us. This is very dangerous but is an alternative way to achieve victory.

The AIs will build Dire CPA Bunkers that will increase the strength of Cross Planet Attacks if not neutralized. On top of that, the AIs will sync their CPAs to strike in unison.

The AI has activated some extra deadly threats. Brutal Guardian Lairs will awaken if we approach within one hop away and steadily build deadly Brutal Guardians. The AI has also built an Ultimate Fortress somewhere in the galaxy.